### 1) detalji -> 200, priceEur = price x 0.00853 zaokruzeno (Proizvod 01: 1000 -> 8.53), bez imageUrl
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products/1

### 2) lista -> 200, stavke su i dalje ProductDto (bez priceEur i imageUrl)
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=5

### 3) stub u rezim greske -> 200, { "mode": "fail" }
POST http://localhost:5299/mode/fail

### 4) posle najmanje 60 s od zahteva 1 -> 200, isti priceEur (fallback iz kesa)
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products/1

### 5) ponovite 4 jos dva puta; treci put odgovor stize za nekoliko ms (prekidac otvoren)
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products/1

### 6) stub nazad u ok; posle 15 s sledeci zahtev 4 prolazi kroz servis (Half-open -> Closed)
POST http://localhost:5299/mode/ok

### 7) CORS preflight sa dev origin-a -> 204, Access-Control-Allow-Origin: http://localhost:5173
OPTIONS https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products/1
Origin: http://localhost:5173
Access-Control-Request-Method: PUT
Access-Control-Request-Headers: content-type

### 8) preflight sa nepoznatog origin-a -> 204, ali BEZ Access-Control-Allow-Origin
OPTIONS https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products/1
Origin: https://evil.example
Access-Control-Request-Method: PUT

### 9a) narudzbenica za proveru statusa -> 201 (posle faze 7 baza nema narudzbenica)
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-User: kupac-1

{ "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 } ],
  "shipping": { "street": "Ulica 1", "city": "Beograd", "postalCode": "11000", "country": "RS" } }

### 9) promena statusa -> 204 (stranica orders.html prikazuje "narudzbenica 1: Shipped")
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/orders/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Shipped" }

### 10) nepostojeca narudzbenica -> 404, type https://minishop.rs/errors/order-not-found
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/orders/999/status
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Shipped" }




////// AUTH


### 1) registracija kupca -> 201, Location: /api/v1/auth/me, telo { id, email }
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "kupac@minishop.rs", "password": "Lozinka123!", "fullName": "Petar Kupac" }

### 2) ista e-adresa -> 400, errors: DuplicateUserName i DuplicateEmail
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "kupac@minishop.rs", "password": "Lozinka123!" }

### 3) slaba lozinka -> 400, errors: PasswordTooShort, PasswordRequiresDigit, PasswordRequiresUpper
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "slaba@minishop.rs", "password": "kratka" }

### 4) prijava kupca -> 200, { userId, email, roles: ["Customer"] }
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "kupac@minishop.rs", "password": "Lozinka123!" }

### 5) prijava admina -> 200, roles: ["Admin"]
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@minishop.rs", "password": "Admin!Lozinka2026" }

### 6) nepostojeci nalog -> 401, isti odgovor kao pogresna lozinka
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "niko@minishop.rs", "password": "Lozinka123!" }

### 7) bez tokena -> 401, zaglavlje WWW-Authenticate: Bearer
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/auth/me

### 8) narudzbenica bez tokena -> 401 (radi ponovo od nedelje 10)
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 } ],
  "shipping": { "street": "Bulevar oslobodjenja 1", "city": "Novi Sad",
                "postalCode": "21000", "country": "RS" } }




/////JWT

# ako @host vec postoji na vrhu fajla, sledeci red preskocite
@host = https://localhost:7150

### 1) registracija kupca -> 201 (400 DuplicateUserName ako postoji iz nedelje 9)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "kupac@minishop.rs", "password": "Lozinka123!", "fullName": "Petar Kupac" }

### 2) prijava -> 200 { accessToken, expiresAt, refreshToken }
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "kupac@minishop.rs", "password": "Lozinka123!" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
@refresh = {{login.response.body.$.refreshToken}}

### 3) bez tokena -> 401, WWW-Authenticate: Bearer
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/mine

### 4) sa tokenom -> 200, [] za novog kupca
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) narudzbenica -> 201, Location: /api/v1/orders/{id}
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [ { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 } ],
  "shipping": { "street": "Bulevar oslobodjenja 1", "city": "Novi Sad",
                "postalCode": "21000", "country": "RS" }
}

### 6) ko sam ja -> 200, roles: ["Customer"]
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7) rotacija -> 200, nov accessToken i nov refreshToken
# @name refresh1
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }

### 8) isti (vec iskorisceni) refresh token ponovo -> 401, porodica opozvana
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh}}" }

### 9) i token dobijen u koraku 7 je sada opozvan -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{refresh1.response.body.$.refreshToken}}" }

### 10) nova prijava, pa odjava -> 204
# @name login2
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "kupac@minishop.rs", "password": "Lozinka123!" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login2.response.body.$.refreshToken}}" }

### 11) refresh posle odjave -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{ "refreshToken": "{{login2.response.body.$.refreshToken}}" }



