POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "kupac2@minishop.rs", "password": "Lozinka123!" }

###
@adminToken = {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
@kupacToken = {{kupac.response.body.$.accessToken}}
@kupac2Token = {{kupac2.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 1) javni katalog bez tokena -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=5

### 2) kategorije bez tokena -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories

### 3) kreiranje proizvoda bez tokena -> 401
POST {{host}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mis", "sku": "MS-200", "price": 1990, "stockQuantity": 5, "categoryId": 1 }

### 4) isto sa tokenom kupca -> 403
POST {{host}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{kupacToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mis", "sku": "MS-200", "price": 1990, "stockQuantity": 5, "categoryId": 1 }

### 5) isto sa admin tokenom -> 201
POST {{host}}/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mis", "sku": "MS-200", "price": 1990, "stockQuantity": 5, "categoryId": 1 }

### 6) brisanje kategorije kao kupac -> 403
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/categories/3
Authorization: Bearer {{kupacToken}}

### 7) kupac cita svoju narudzbenicu (Id iz GET orders/mine) -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{kupacToken}}

### 8) drugi kupac cita istu -> 403, type https://minishop.rs/errors/not-owner
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{kupac2Token}}

### 9) admin cita istu -> 200
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10) promena statusa kao kupac -> 403, kao admin -> 204
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{kupacToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Shipped" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Shipped" }

### 11) OpenAPI dokument bez tokena -> 200
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json





//REDIS

### 1) prvi poziv -> 200, ETag: W/"<vreme>-<broj>", Cache-Control: public, max-age=60
###    u konzoli: SQL upit ka Products
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=5

### 2) isti poziv -> 200, zaglavlje Age (odgovor iz output kesa), bez SQL-a u konzoli
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=5

### 3) drugi filter -> 200, drugaciji rezultat (VaryByQuery radi), nema Age
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=5&categoryId=2

### 4) uslovni GET sa ETag-om iz odgovora 1 -> 304, prazno telo
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=5
If-None-Match: W/"20260924101500123-12"

### 5) prijava admina (Seed:AdminEmail, lozinka iz User Secrets) -> 200, accessToken
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@minishop.rs", "password": " Admin!Lozinka2026" }

### 6) novi proizvod -> 201; invalidacija HybridCache i output kesa
POST https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mis bezicni", "sku": "MS-300", "price": 1990, "stockQuantity": 25, "categoryId": 1 }

### 7) stari ETag -> 200 (ne 304), novi ETag sa brojem N+1, totalCount veci za 1
GET https://localhost:7150/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=5
If-None-Match: W/"20260924101500123-12"